{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddy up online or locally in this two-player co-op adventure! Test your teamwork as you swing, scale, and navigate the home of an unhinged teenager. Learn to co-operate... or probably just rage quit. Has your friendship got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAND-TAGONIST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s up with this sadistic kid? Outmanoeuvre the hand-tagonist, a tiny tyrant with way too much time on his <i>hands</i>. Just when you think you\u2019re getting somewhere, he\u2019ll pop up to squash your hopes of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/5c470b902df5be874f08a3455f7c7c99.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CLIMB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenging, physics-based climbing where every grab, swing, and slip could be your last. Miss a jump and it\u2019s back to the floor, but isn\u2019t falling half the fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/fb5c1e2f233bb45806d1ba6efaa1e287.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90S NOSTALGIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro toys, old tunes, chunky furniture, and enough 90s chaos to mend your childhood trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/78ab66193f21df380f452119d458ac20.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME STRETCH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a full-scale house. Five rooms, each packed with unique hazards, interactive objects, and increasingly unfair level design.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/e2226256b0cdb652f1046bcd681b66f4.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. If you don\u2019t escape the attic you\u2019re trash.\u00a0</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295360?t=1759499958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/a834e8cef11703d42ab49ebd6c2149711bdd3e06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759499958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/25b2821153481e34f6dbd1511504a49385576b2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759499958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/25b2821153481e34f6dbd1511504a49385576b2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759499958","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3839730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.webm?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/72dd1f5f4cbed3530a031e4d9d6aec92.mp4?t=1759499958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddy up online or locally in this two-player co-op adventure! Test your teamwork as you swing, scale, and navigate the home of an unhinged teenager. Learn to co-operate... or probably just rage quit. Has your friendship got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4f93672f8c2153238129f4f4c1225f24.poster.avif?t=1759499958\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295360/extras/4f93672f8c